From: Jan Catrysse <jan.catrysse@geoxyz.eu>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 06:31:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add wiki page attachments to the wiki ZIP export.

The ZIP export added in #43978 exports page sources only. With
with_attachments, the archive mirrors the wiki hierarchy instead: one
directory per page, nested by parent, holding that page's source and its
attachments. A bare-filename reference in the source, such as
!diagram.png!, therefore resolves once the archive is unpacked.

Without the parameter the archive is unchanged, byte for byte.

The total attachment size is checked against bulk_download_max_size, as
AttachmentsController#download_all does, so the text-only export keeps
working for a wiki whose attachments exceed the limit.
